	(text "Next revision: Possible to use charging circuit that allows for both USB operation \nand battery operation without frying the VBat pin on the uC \n(which is 4V tolerant) while still allowing everything including the LDO \nto be switched off? Wakeup via encoder button. Remember to use the encoder \nbutton with a pullup to battery voltage or with a uC pullup. \n\nAlternative: Are there 5V-tolerant MCUs?"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
